{"text": "But since we don't have a 3, we look at combinations of the numbers we have.", "start": 479, "end": 555, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We can use division to get 4:", "start": 556, "end": 585, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "7 - 1 = 6", "start": 587, "end": 596, "label": "inform"}
