{"text": "6 / 1.5 = 4", "start": 608, "end": 619, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "However, since 1.5 is not directly obtainable from the given numbers using the allowed operations, we need to rethink our approach.", "start": 621, "end": 752, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "3. A simpler and valid approach that works directly is:", "start": 754, "end": 809, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 1) × (5 - 2) = 6 × 3 = 18", "start": 811, "end": 841, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "This is not yet correct.", "start": 843, "end": 867, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "Let's try another approach.", "start": 868, "end": 895, "label": "suggest"}
{"text": "4. A working solution is:", "start": 897, "end": 922, "label": "inform"}
