{"text": "4.5 × 7 = 31.5", "start": 1018, "end": 1032, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "We are close, but need to adjust.", "start": 1034, "end": 1067, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "The correct path is:", "start": 1068, "end": 1088, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "(7 - 1) × (5 / 2) + 2", "start": 1090, "end": 1111, "label": "inform"}
