{"text": "(7 - 1) × (5 / 2) + 2 = 6 × 2.5 = 15 + 9 = 24", "start": 1314, "end": 1359, "label": "inform"}
{"text": "So the correct solution is:", "start": 1361, "end": 1388, "label": "inform"}
